  "date": "'March 4, 2009'",
  "content": "I had been having intense fever for three days with great bodily pain and a rapid heartbeat. Suddenly, I was walking through a grain field with vivid radiant light making the surroundings seem more alive. In the distance, I saw two twin buildings with a majestic symmetry. I felt someone next to me. I asked what the buildings were, and I was told that angels just built the building and sung there. I was walked towards the buildings. There was a portal that joined the two buildings, and as I walked forward I requested if I could enter, but was told 'No.' I had to go back and fight. I passed through the portal and I woke in extreme pain in my body, and went to the hospital.",
